        "node_id": "n_3_3f1492",
        "thought_text": "Consider using a priority queue (min-heap) to always process the exam that offers the greatest potential improvement per essay written, ensuring that we efficiently reach the target average with the minimum number of essays. This approach prioritizes high-value improvements over lower ones, potentially reducing the overall number of essays needed.",
